sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Flutter UI
    participant API as ElysiaJS API
    participant DB as Neon DB

    UI->>API: POST /bills {name, date, service_charge_pct, vat_pct}
    API->>DB: INSERT bills
    DB-->>API: bill {id, invite_code}
    API-->>UI: bill created
    UI->>UI: navigate → Add Items Screen

    loop User adds each item manually
        UI->>UI: optimistic update (show item immediately)
        UI->>API: POST /bills/:id/items {name, quantity, unit_price}
        API->>DB: INSERT bill_items
        DB-->>API: item record
        API-->>UI: confirmed
        alt API error
            UI->>UI: rollback optimistic update
        end
    end

    UI->>UI: navigate → Assign Screen
